# Cell: ArcRwLock · String · call-returned · no-spawn · pre-fix ICE 101 ·
# post-fix `hello`
#
# Part of the shared-var-decl class-fix fixture net (Core #11/#12). Pins the
# ArcRwLock arm at src/ir/lowering/stmts/mod.rs:1764 distinctly from the
# ArcMutex arm (:1813) and the ArcOnly arm (:1709). The `shared(rwlock)`
# explicit strategy tag drives CFA to ArcRwLock.
#
# Uses call-returned (not concat) — the concat shape on ArcRwLock exposes a
# separate double-free at runtime (unrelated to this Move-follow-through
# class-fix; the ICE 101 was hiding it). Filed as a follow-up.

String make():
    return "hello"

void main():
    shared(rwlock) String s = make()
    with s:
        print(s)
